<title>CHINA: China Jan-July aluminium output up 15.1 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>China Jan-July aluminium output up 15.1 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>China produced 1.0196 million tonnes of aluminium in the first seven months of this year, up 15.1 percent compared with the year-ago period, figures made available on Friday showed.</p>
<p>China's aluminium output was 181,900 tonnes in July alone, the State Statistical Bureau said.</p>
<p>Output of aluminium products reached 674,700 tonnes in the first seven months, up by 9.8 percent, it said. Output for July alone was 105,000 tonnes, up by 0.57 percent from June, it said.</p>
<p>China's alumina output reached 1.7245 million tonnes in the first seven months, down 12.3 percent year-on-year, it said.</p>
<p>China produced 248,200 tonnes of alumina in July alone, the bureau said.</p>
<p>-- Beijing Newsroom (86) 10-6532-1921; Fax 10-6532-4978</p>
